        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS... are delighted to present this magnificent 3 bedroom duplex spanning approx. 85 sq mtrs to the local property market. We know this fantastic spacious property approx. 915 sq ft will impress you all. This light filled home is located with its own door access of an established development and is a striking three bedroom residence with fine modern decor merging with functionality and comfort.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hall, living room, kitchen/dining area and downstairs WC. Upstairs comprises of three bedrooms (One Master En-Suite) and main bathroom. Another great feature this property has to offer is a private balcony area. With a flowing open plan scheme, kitchen equipped with a host of appliances we are confident this well finished apartment will tick all the boxes on the property search list.\r\n\r\n24 Church View is located within walking distance of the city centre and convenient to the numerous shops, cafes, bars and restaurants Drumcondra village has to offer. The green open spaces nearby, including Griffith Park a mere 5 minutes away and the Botanic Garden just a stone’s throw further, and the close proximity to the city give this location the perfect combination of leafy neighbourhood life and urban buzz.\r\n\r\nLocal national schools include Corpus Christi National School, Scoil Mobhi, St Patrick’s National School and Grace Park Educate Together. Secondary schools within walking distance include Scoil Caitriona, Holy Faith Secondary Schools, Dominican College, Rosmini and Clonturk. There’s also a variety of local sports clubs including Na Fíanna GAA Club and Tolka Park Shelbourne FC. For lazy weekend brunches, lunch and dinner spots like Anderson’s Café and Shouk Restaurant are only a short stroll away. For those travelling further afield, the M50, the M1 and Dublin Airport are also within easy access.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer. Viewing by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-8844690"
      },
